_0002> If <MATH_0010> is a curve, we don't learn anything.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0011> is a Cohen-Macaulay (for example normal) surface, then\n<MATH_0012>\nis an isomorphism.\n<STRUCT_0004> If <MATH_0013> is a Cohen-Macaulay threefold, then\n<MATHSEG_0001>and<MATHSEG_0002>\nare isomorphisms.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nPresumably the pattern is clear. If <MATH_0014> is a normal threefold, then\nwe can conclude the result for <MATH_0015> but not for <MATH_0016>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:30a7d147af2b587a3fdd0662634f6b8e4de33d34f649670680ba3fff4697377a", "unit_id": "tag:0EL3:statement"}
